1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:02,580
May solar ka, pero may
Meralco bill ka pa rin?

2
00:00:02,930 --> 00:00:05,860
Hello, SoSmart viewers!
Kuya SoLight 'to!

3
00:00:06,210 --> 00:00:08,660
Sa typical
self-consumption setup,

4
00:00:08,740 --> 00:00:12,290
tumutulong ang solar sa
daytime electricity use mo.

5
00:00:12,590 --> 00:00:14,740
Pero kapag kulang
ang solar generation,

6
00:00:14,820 --> 00:00:16,710
o gabi na at wala
kang battery,

7
00:00:16,790 --> 00:00:19,020
puwede ka pa ring kumuha
ng kuryente sa grid.

8
00:00:19,320 --> 00:00:22,100
May mga bill charges din
na hindi basta nawawala.

9
00:00:22,350 --> 00:00:25,720
Kaya hindi dapat mangako
ng automatic zero bill.

10
00:00:26,120 --> 00:00:31,650
Dahil ang gusto ni Kuya SoLight…
naka-solar ka na, SoSmart ka pa!

11
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:34,020
Life is SoLight with Solar.
